// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 polyhedral scheduling, dependence testing, tiling, and auto-vectorization companion submodules.
//   2. Re-export public constructors, diagnostic helpers, and master compiler optimization pipelines.
//   3. Maintain standard unified entry point for openOODA compiler optimization subsystems.

